gan_1943_poster_-_restoration1.jpg/250px-UN_Fight_for_Freedom_Leslie_Ragan_1943_poster_-_restoration1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/UN_Fight_for_Freedom_Leslie_Ragan_1943_poster_-_restoration1.jpg/500px-UN_Fight_for_Freedom_Leslie_Ragan_1943_poster_-_restoration1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="4745" data-file-height="6708" data-file-type="bitmap" height="353" width="250" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span><div class="ib-country-map-caption">A 1943 propaganda poster showing the flags of many of the members of the Allies, including the "Big Four"
<hr/>
<style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r1126788409" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" about="#mwt9" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Plainlist/styles.css"}}'>.mw-parser-output .plainlist ol,.mw-parser-output .plainlist ul{line-height:inherit;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .plainlist ol li,.mw-parser-output .plainlist ul li{margin-bottom:0}</style><div class="plainlist " style=" padding-left: 0.6em; text-align: left;"><b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Big_Three_(World_War_II)" title="Big Three (World War II)">The Big Three:</a></b>
<ul><li><span data-sort-value="United Kingdom"><span class="flagicon"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_the_United_Kingdom_(1-2).svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/Flag_of_the_United_Kingdom_%281-2%29.svg/40px-Flag_of_the_United_Kingdom_%281-2%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/Flag_of_the_United_Kingdom_%281-2%29.svg/60px-Flag_of_the_United_Kingdom_%281-2%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="" data-file-width="1200" data-file-height="600" data-file-type="drawing" height="12" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span></span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_Kingdom" title="United Kingdom">United Kingdom</a></span> (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_Kingdom_declaration_of_war_on_Germany_(1939)" title="United Kingdom declaration of war on Germany (1939)" class="mw-redirect">from September 1939</a>)</li>
<li><span data-sort-value="Soviet Union"><span class="flagicon"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_the_Soviet_Union_(1936_–_1955).svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/Flag_of_the_Soviet_Union_%281936_%E2%80%93_1955%29.svg/40px-Flag_of_the_Soviet_Union_%281936_%E2%80%93_1955%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/Flag_of_the_Soviet_Union_%281936_%E2%80%93_1955%29.svg/60px-Flag_of_the_Soviet_Union_%281936_%E2%80%93_1955%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="" data-file-width="1000" data-file-height="500" data-file-type="drawing" height="12" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span></span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Soviet_Union" title="Soviet Union">Soviet Union</a></span> (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Barbarossa" title="Operation Barbarossa">from June 1941</a>)</li>
<li><span data-sort-value="United States"><span class="flagicon"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_the_United_States_(1912-1959).svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Flag_of_the_United_States_%281912-1959%29.svg/40px-Flag_of_the_United_States_%281912-1959%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Flag_of_the_United_States_%281912-1959%29.svg/60px-Flag_of_the_United_States_%281912-1959%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="" data-file-width="1235" data-file-height="650" data-file-type="drawing" height="12" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span></span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States" title="United States">United States</a></span> (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Attack_on_Pearl_Harbor" title="Attack on Pearl Harbor">from December 1941</a>)</li></ul>

</div>
<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#Summary" class="mw-selflink-fragment">Full list</a></div></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label">Status</th><td class="infobox-data"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Collective_security#Collective_defense" title="Collective security">Military alliance</a></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label">Historical era</th><td class="infobox-data"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_War_II" title="World War II">World War II</a></td></tr><tr class="mergedrow infobox-hiddenrow"><td colspan="2" class="infobox-full-data"><span class="mw-empty-elt"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1358620234" about="#mwt10" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Infobox/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'/></span></td></tr><tr class="mergedrow"><th scope="row" class="infobox-label"><div style="text-indent:-0.9em;margin-left:1.2em;font-weight:normal;">•<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Franco-Polish_alliance_(1921)" title="Franco-Polish alliance (1921)" class="mw-redirect">Franco-Polish alliance</a> </div></th><td class="infobox-data"><span class="nowrap">21 February 1921</span></td></tr><tr class="mergedrow"><th scope="row" class="infobox-label"><div style="text-indent:-0.9em;margin-left:1.2em;font-weight:normal;">•<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anglo-Polish_military_alliance" title="Anglo-Polish military alliance" class="mw-redirect">Anglo-Polish alliance</a> </div></th><td class="infobox-data">August 1939</td></tr><tr class="mergedrow"><th scope="row" class="infobox-label"><div style="text-indent:-0.9em;margin-left:1.2em;font-weight:normal;">•<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anglo-French_Supreme_War_Council" title="Anglo-French Supreme War Council">Anglo-French War Council</a> </div></th><td class="infobox-data"><span class="nowrap">September 1939<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>– June 1940</span></td></tr><tr class="mergedrow"><th scope="row" class="infobox-label"><div style="text-indent:-0.9em;margin-left:1.2em;font-weight:normal;">•<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Declaration_of_St_James's_Palace" title="Declaration of St James's Palace">First Inter-Allied Meeting</a> </div></th><td class="infobox-data"><span class="nowrap">June 1941</span></td></tr><tr class="mergedrow"><th scope="row" class="infobox-label"><div style="text-indent:-0.9em;margin-left:1.2em;font-weight:normal;">•<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anglo-Soviet_Agreement" title="Anglo-Soviet Agreement">Anglo-Soviet alliance</a> </div></th><td class="infobox-data"><span class="nowrap">July 1941</span></td></tr><tr class="mergedrow"><th scope="row" class="infobox-label"><div style="text-indent:-0.9em;margin-left:1.2em;font-weight:normal;">•<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Atlantic_Charter" title="Atlantic Charter">Atlantic Charter</a> </div></th><td class="infobox-data"><span class="nowrap">August 1941</span></td></tr><tr class="mergedrow"><th scope="row" class="infobox-label"><div style="text-indent:-0.9em;margin-left:1.2em;font-weight:normal;">•<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Declaration_by_United_Nations" title="Declaration by United Nations">Declaration by United Nations</a> </div></th><td class="infobox-data"><span class="nowrap">January 1942</span></td></tr><tr class="mergedrow"><th scope="row" class="infobox-label"><div style="text-indent:-0.9em;margin-left:1.2em;font-weight:normal;">•<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anglo-Soviet_Treaty_of_1942" title="Anglo-Soviet Treaty of 1942">Anglo-Soviet Treaty</a> </div></th><td class="infobox-data"><span class="nowrap">May 1942</span></td></tr><tr class="mergedrow"><th scope="row" class="infobox-label"><div style="text-indent:-0.9em;margin-left:1.2em;font-weight:normal;">•<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tehran_Conference" title="Tehran Conference">Tehran Conference</a> </div></th><td class="infobox-data"><span class="nowrap">November–December 1943</span></td></tr><tr class="mergedrow"><th scope="row" class="infobox-label"><div style="text-indent:-0.9em;margin-left:1.2em;font-weight:normal;">•<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><span class="nowrap"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bretton_Woods_Conference" title="Bretton Woods Conference">Bretton Woods Conference</a></span> </div></th><td class="infobox-data">1–15 July 1944</td></tr><tr class="mergedrow"><th scope="row" class="infobox-label"><div style="text-indent:-0.9em;margin-left:1.2em;font-weight:normal;">•<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yalta_Conference" title="Yalta Conference">Yalta Conference</a> </div></th><td class="infobox-data">4–11 February 1945</td></tr><tr class="mergedrow"><th scope="row" class="infobox-label"><div style="text-indent:-0.9em;margin-left:1.2em;font-weight:normal;">•<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_Nations_Conference_on_International_Organization" title="United Nations Conference on International Organization">United Nations formed</a> </div></th><td class="infobox-data"><span class="nowrap">April–June 1945</span></td></tr><tr class="mergedrow"><th scope="row" class="infobox-label"><div style="text-indent:-0.9em;margin-left:1.2em;font-weight:normal;">•<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Potsdam_Conference" title="Potsdam Conference">Potsdam Conference</a> </div></th><td class="infobox-data">July–August 1945</td></tr><tr style="display:none"><td colspan="2">
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" class="infobox-full-data">
