</section><section data-mw-section-id="60" id="mwCCg" aria-labelledby="Cold_War"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Cold_War">Cold War</h3></div>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt736" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCCk" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Main","href":"./Template:Main"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Cold War"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237" about="#mwt737" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Hatnote/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'/></span><div role="note" class="hatnote navigation-not-searchable" about="#mwt736" id="mwCCo">Main article: <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cold_War" title="Cold War">Cold War</a></div>

<p id="mwCCs">Despite the successful creation of the United Nations, the alliance of the Soviet Union with the United States and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anglo-Soviet_Treaty_of_1942" title="Anglo-Soviet Treaty of 1942" id="mwCCw">with the United Kingdom</a> ultimately broke down and evolved into the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cold_War" title="Cold War" id="mwCC0">Cold War</a>, which took place over the following half-century.<sup about="#mwt740" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-BBC_Bitesize-1941_132-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"BBC Bitesize-1941"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-BBC_Bitesize-1941-132"}}'><a href="#cite_note-BBC_Bitesize-1941-132" id="mwCC4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwCC8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCDA">[</span>130<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCDE">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt743" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Roos-2020_133-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"Roos-2020"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Roos-2020-133"}}'><a href="#cite_note-Roos-2020-133" id="mwCDI"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwCDM"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCDQ">[</span>131<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCDU">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section></section><section data-mw-section-id="61" id="mwCDY" aria-labelledby="Summary"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Summary">Summary</h2></div>
<figure class="mw-default-size" typeof="mw:File/Thumb" id="mwCDc"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Freedom_shall_prevail!_-_DPLA_-_b0c9b437727d3a683688c8a4860772b5.jpg" class="mw-file-description" id="mwCDg"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Freedom_shall_prevail!_-_DPLA_-_b0c9b437727d3a683688c8a4860772b5.jpg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ac/Freedom_shall_prevail%21_-_DPLA_-_b0c9b437727d3a683688c8a4860772b5.jpg/250px-Freedom_shall_prevail%21_-_DPLA_-_b0c9b437727d3a683688c8a4860772b5.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ac/Freedom_shall_prevail%21_-_DPLA_-_b0c9b437727d3a683688c8a4860772b5.jpg/500px-Freedom_shall_prevail%21_-_DPLA_-_b0c9b437727d3a683688c8a4860772b5.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="8996" data-file-height="5958" data-file-type="bitmap" height="166" width="250" class="mw-file-element" id="mwCDk"/></a><figcaption id="mwCDo">Poster with <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/V_sign" title="V sign" id="mwCDs">V for Victory</a></figcaption></figure>

<p id="mwCDw">The Big Four:</p>

<ul id="mwCD0"><li id="mwCD4"><span data-sort-value="United Kingdom" about="#mwt744" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCD8" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"flagcountry","href":"./Template:Flagcountry"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"United Kingdom"}},"i":0}}]}'><span class="flagicon"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_the_United_Kingdom_(1-2).svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/Flag_of_the_United_Kingdom_%281-2%29.svg/40px-Flag_of_the_United_Kingdom_%281-2%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/Flag_of_the_United_Kingdom_%281-2%29.svg/60px-Flag_of_the_United_Kingdom_%281-2%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="" data-file-width="1200" data-file-height="600" data-file-type="drawing" height="12" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span></span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_Kingdom" title="United Kingdom">United Kingdom</a></span> (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_Kingdom_declaration_of_war_on_Germany_(1939)" title="United Kingdom declaration of war on Germany (1939)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwCEA">from 3 September 1939</a>)
<ul id="mwCEE"><li id="mwCEI"><span data-sort-value="India" about="#mwt745" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCEM" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"flagcountry","href":"./Template:Flagcountry"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"British Raj"}},"i":0}}]}'><span class="flagicon"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:British_Raj_Red_Ensign.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/British_Raj_Red_Ensign.svg/40px-British_Raj_Red_Ensign.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/British_Raj_Red_Ensign.svg/60px-British_Raj_Red_Ensign.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="" data-file-width="600" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="drawing" height="12" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span></span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/British_Raj" title="British Raj">India</a></span></li>
<li id="mwCEQ"><span data-sort-value="Australia" about="#mwt746" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCEU" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"flagcountry","href":"./Template:Flagcountry"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Australia"}},"i":0}}]}'><span class="flagicon"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Australia_(converted).svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/88/Flag_of_Australia_%28converted%29.svg/40px-Flag_of_Australia_%28converted%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/88/Flag_of_Australia_%28converted%29.svg/60px-Flag_of_Australia_%28converted%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="" data-file-width="1280" data-file-height="640" data-file-type="drawing" height="12" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span></span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Australia" title="Australia">Australia</a></span></li>
<li id="mwCEY"><span data-sort-value="New Zealand" about="#mwt747" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCEc" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"flagcountry","href":"./Template:Flagcountry"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Dominion of New Zealand"}},"i":0}}]}'><span class="flagicon"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_New_Zealand.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3e/Flag_of_New_Zealand.svg/40px-Flag_of_New_Zealand.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3e/Flag_of_New_Zealand.svg/60px-Flag_of_New_Zealand.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="" data-file-width="1200" data-file-height="600" data-file-type="drawing" height="12" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span></span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dominion_of_New_Zealand" title="Dominion of New Zealand">New Zealand</a></span></li>
<li id="mwCEg"><span data-sort-value="South Africa" about="#mwt748" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCEk" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"flagcountry","href":"./Template:Flagcountry"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Union of South Africa"}},"i":0}}]}'><span class="flagicon"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_South_Africa_(1928-1982).svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a6/Flag_of_South_Africa_%281928%E2%80%931994%2C_dark_colors%29.svg/40px-Flag_of_South_Africa_%281928%E2%80%931994%2C_dark_colors%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a6/Flag_of_South_Africa_%281928%E2%80%931994%2C_dark_colors%29.svg/60px-Flag_of_South_Africa_%281928%E2%80%931994%2C_dark_colors%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="" data-file-width="900" data-file-height="600" data-file-type="drawing" height="15" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span></span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Union_of_South_Africa" title="Union of South Africa">South Africa</a></span></li>
<li id="mwCEo"><span data-sort-value="Canada" about="#mwt749" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCEs" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"flagcountry","href":"./Template:Flagcountry"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Canada"},"2":{"wt":"1921"}},"i":0}}]}'><span class="flagicon"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Canadian_Red_Ensign_(1921–1957).svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Flag_of_Canada_%281921%E2%80%931957%29.svg/40px-Flag_of_Canada_%281921%E2%80%931957%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Flag_of_Canada_%281921%E2%80%931957%29.svg/60px-Flag_of_Canada_%281921%E2%80%931957%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="" data-file-width="1200" data-file-height="600" data-file-type="drawing" height="12" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span></span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Canada" title="Canada">Canada</a></span></li></ul></li>
<li id="mwCEw"><span data-sort-value="Soviet Union" about="#mwt750" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCE0" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"flagcountry","href":"./Template:Flagcountry"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Soviet Union"},"2":{"wt":"1936"}},"i":0}}]}'><span class="flagicon"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_the_Soviet_Union_(1936_–_1955).svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/Flag_of_the_Soviet_Union_%281936_%E2%80%93_1955%29.svg/40px-Flag_of_the_Soviet_Union_%281936_%E2%80%93_1955%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/Flag_of_the_Soviet_Union_%281936_%E2%80%93_1955%29.svg/60px-Flag_of_the_Soviet_Union_%281936_%E2%80%93_1955%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="" data-file-width="1000" data-file-height="500" data-file-type="drawing" height="12" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span></span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Soviet_Union" title="Soviet Union">Soviet Union</a></span> (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Barbarossa" title="Operation Barbarossa" id="mwCE4">from 22 June 1941</a>)</li>
<li id="mwCE8"><span data-sort-value="United States" about="#mwt751" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCFA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"flagcountry","href":"./Template:Flagcountry"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"United States"},"2":{"wt":"1912"}},"i":0}}]}'><span class="flagicon"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_the_United_States_(1912-1959).svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Flag_of_the_United_States_%281912-1959%29.svg/40px-Flag_of_the_United_States_%281912-1959%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Flag_of_the_United_States_%281912-1959%29.svg/60px-Flag_of_the_United_States_%281912-1959%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="" data-file-width="1235" data-file-height="650" data-file-type="drawing" height="12" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span></span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States" title="United States">United States</a></span> (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Attack_on_Pearl_Harbor" title="Attack on Pearl Harbor" id="mwCFE">from 7 December 1941</a>)</li>
<li id="mwCFI"><span data-sort-value="China" about="#mwt752" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCFM" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"flagcountry","href":"./Template:Flagcountry"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Republic of China (1912-1949)"},"2":{"wt":"1940"}},"i":0}}]}'><span class="flagicon"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_the_Republic_of_China.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/Flag_of_the_Republic_of_China.svg/40px-Flag_of_the_Republic_of_China.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/Flag_of_the_Republic_of_China.svg/60px-Flag_of_the_Republic_of_China.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="" data-file-width="900" data-file-height="600" data-file-type="drawing" height="15" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span></span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republic_of_China_(1912–1949)" title="Republic of China (1912–1949)">China</a></span><sup about="#mwt753" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-RoC_134-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"note","name":"RoC"}}'><a href="#cite_note-RoC-134" data-mw-group="note" id="mwCFQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwCFU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCFY">[</span>note 3<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCFc">]</span></span></a></sup> (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Second_Sino-Japanese_War" title="Second Sino-Japanese War" id="mwCFg">from 9 December 1941</a>)</li></ul>

<p id="mwCFk">Allied combatant states and allied governments in exile:</p>

<ul id="mwCFo"><li id="mwCFs"><span class="flagicon" about="#mwt754" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCFw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"flagdeco","href":"./Template:Flagdeco"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Free French"}},"i":0}}]}'><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Free_France_(1940-1944).svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c9/Flag_of_Free_France_%281940-1944%29.svg/40px-Flag_of_Free_France_%281940-1944%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c9/Flag_of_Free_France_%281940-1944%29.svg/60px-Flag_of_Free_France_%281940-1944%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="341" data-file-type="drawing" height="15" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></span></span></span> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Free_France" title="Free France" id="mwCF0">Free France</a><sup about="#mwt755" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FFF_135-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"note","name":"FFF"}}'><a href="#cite_note-FFF-135" data-mw-group="note" id="mwCF4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwCF8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCGA">[</span>note 4<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCGE">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
<li id="mwCGI"><span data-sort-value="Poland" about="#mwt756" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCGM" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"flagcountry","href":"./Template:Flagcountry"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Polish government-in-exile"}},"i":0}}]}'><span class="flagicon"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Poland_(1928–1980).svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/41/Flag_of_Poland_%281928%E2%80%931980%29.svg/40px-Flag_of_Poland_%281928%E2%80%931980%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/41/Flag_of_Poland_%281928%E2%80%931980%29.svg/60px-Flag_of_Poland_%281928%E2%80%931980%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="" data-file-width="1280" data-file-height="800" data-file-type="drawing" height="14" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span></span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Polish_government-in-exile" title="Polish government-in-exile">Poland</a></span><sup about="#mwt757" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-PL_136-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"note","name":"PL"}}'><a href="#cite_note-PL-136" data-mw-group="note" id="mwCGQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwCGU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCGY">[</span>note 5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCGc">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
