</section><section data-mw-section-id="65" id="mwCn8" aria-labelledby="1941"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="1941">1941</h3></div>
<!-- The following flags/countries represent formal declarations of war by independent states, not declarations by provisional governments, colonial regimes on behalf of colonies, or other non&#x2D;independent countries. The Philippines' foreign and military affairs were controlled, ultimately by the United States during World War II, although it had an elected government that was formally represented in international forums.-->
<ul id="mwCoA"><li id="mwCoE"><span class="flagicon" about="#mwt1019" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCoI" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"flagicon","href":"./Template:Flagicon"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Kingdom of Yugoslavia"}},"i":0}}]}'><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kingdom_of_Yugoslavia" title="Kingdom of Yugoslavia"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Yugoslavia_(1918–1943).svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e5/Flag_of_Yugoslavia_%281918%E2%80%931941%29.svg/40px-Flag_of_Yugoslavia_%281918%E2%80%931941%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e5/Flag_of_Yugoslavia_%281918%E2%80%931941%29.svg/60px-Flag_of_Yugoslavia_%281918%E2%80%931941%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="Kingdom of Yugoslavia" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="341" data-file-type="drawing" height="15" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span></span> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kingdom_of_Yugoslavia" title="Kingdom of Yugoslavia" id="mwCoM">Yugoslavia</a>: 6 April 1941 (Yugoslavia signed the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tripartite_Pact" title="Tripartite Pact" id="mwCoQ">Tripartite Pact</a>, becoming a nominal member of the Axis on 25 March. The signing of the pact was met with <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yugoslav_coup_d'état" title="Yugoslav coup d'état" id="mwCoU">coup d'état</a> on 27 March by pro-western forces which led to <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Invasion_of_Yugoslavia" title="Invasion of Yugoslavia" id="mwCoY">an invasion by the Axis</a> on 6 April 1941.)<sup about="#mwt1022" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-151" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-151"}}'><a href="#cite_note-151" id="mwCoc"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwCog"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCok">[</span>144<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCoo">]</span></span></a></sup></li></ul>
<!--PLEASE NOTE: This line has been the subject of persistent misconceptions. Please check Talk:Allies of World War II#USSR (the USSR section on talk) and make sure that you are not
replicating them if you intend to edit the line. It is probably a wise idea to discuss on that page FIRST, before editing. The USSR was at war with Poland in 1939, not any other Allied country. --><figure class="mw-default-size" typeof="mw:File/Thumb" id="mwCos"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Poster_russian.jpg" class="mw-file-description" id="mwCow"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Poster_russian.jpg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/88/Poster_russian.jpg/250px-Poster_russian.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/88/Poster_russian.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x" data-file-width="422" data-file-height="585" data-file-type="bitmap" height="263" width="190" class="mw-file-element mw-file-upright" style="--mw-file-upright: 0.75" id="mwCo0"/></a><figcaption id="mwCo4">U.S. government poster showing a friendly <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Red_Army" title="Red Army" id="mwCo8">Soviet soldier</a>, 1942</figcaption></figure>
<ul id="mwCpA"><li id="mwCpE"><span class="flagicon" about="#mwt1023" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCpI" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"flagicon","href":"./Template:Flagicon"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Soviet Union"},"2":{"wt":"1936"}},"i":0}}]}'><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Soviet_Union" title="Soviet Union"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_the_Soviet_Union_(1936_–_1955).svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/Flag_of_the_Soviet_Union_%281936_%E2%80%93_1955%29.svg/40px-Flag_of_the_Soviet_Union_%281936_%E2%80%93_1955%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/Flag_of_the_Soviet_Union_%281936_%E2%80%93_1955%29.svg/60px-Flag_of_the_Soviet_Union_%281936_%E2%80%93_1955%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="Soviet Union" data-file-width="1000" data-file-height="500" data-file-type="drawing" height="12" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span></span> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Soviet_Union" title="Soviet Union" id="mwCpM">Soviet Union</a>: 22 June 1941; Despite membership of the Soviet Union, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ukrainian_Soviet_Socialist_Republic" title="Ukrainian Soviet Socialist Republic" id="mwCpQ">Ukraine</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Byelorussian_Soviet_Socialist_Republic" title="Byelorussian Soviet Socialist Republic" id="mwCpU">Belarus</a> were recognized as separate fighting states by the United Kingdom and the United States at the end of the war.<link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:All_articles_with_unsourced_statements" about="#mwt1024" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCpY" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"citation needed","href":"./Template:Citation_needed"},"params":{"date":{"wt":"February 2015"}},"i":0}}]}'/><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_with_unsourced_statements_from_February_2015" about="#mwt1024"/><sup class="noprint Inline-Template Template-Fact" style="white-space:nowrap;" about="#mwt1024" id="mwCpc"><span typeof="mw:Entity">[</span><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Citation_needed" title="Wikipedia:Citation needed"><span title="This claim needs references to reliable sources. (February 2015)">citation needed</span></a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity">]</span></sup></li>
<li id="mwCpg"><span class="flagicon" about="#mwt1025" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCpk" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"flagicon","href":"./Template:Flagicon"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Panama"}},"i":0}}]}'><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Panama" title="Panama"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Panama.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ab/Flag_of_Panama.svg/40px-Flag_of_Panama.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ab/Flag_of_Panama.svg/60px-Flag_of_Panama.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="Panama" data-file-width="900" data-file-height="600" data-file-type="drawing" height="15" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span></span> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Panama" title="Panama" id="mwCpo">Panama</a>: 7 December 1941<link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:All_articles_with_unsourced_statements" about="#mwt1026" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCps" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Citation needed","href":"./Template:Citation_needed"},"params":{"date":{"wt":"February 2015"}},"i":0}}]}'/><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_with_unsourced_statements_from_February_2015" about="#mwt1026"/><sup class="noprint Inline-Template Template-Fact" style="white-space:nowrap;" about="#mwt1026" id="mwCpw"><span typeof="mw:Entity">[</span><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Citation_needed" title="Wikipedia:Citation needed"><span title="This claim needs references to reliable sources. (February 2015)">citation needed</span></a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity">]</span></sup></li>
<li id="mwCp0"><span class="flagicon" about="#mwt1027" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCp4" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"flagicon","href":"./Template:Flagicon"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"United States"},"2":{"wt":"1912"}},"i":0}}]}'><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States" title="United States"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_the_United_States_(1912-1959).svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Flag_of_the_United_States_%281912-1959%29.svg/40px-Flag_of_the_United_States_%281912-1959%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Flag_of_the_United_States_%281912-1959%29.svg/60px-Flag_of_the_United_States_%281912-1959%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="United States" data-file-width="1235" data-file-height="650" data-file-type="drawing" height="12" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span></span> United States: 8 December 1941 (war declared on Japan after the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Attack_on_Pearl_Harbor" title="Attack on Pearl Harbor" id="mwCp8">Pearl Harbor attack</a>)<sup about="#mwt1030" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-152" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-152"}}'><a href="#cite_note-152" id="mwCqA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwCqE"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCqI">[</span>145<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCqM">]</span></span></a></sup>
