<li id="mwC6M"><span class="flagicon" about="#mwt1111" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwC6Q" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"flagicon","href":"./Template:Flagicon"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Saudi Arabia"},"2":{"wt":"1938"}},"i":0}}]}'><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saudi_Arabia" title="Saudi Arabia"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Saudi_Arabia_(1938–1973).svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c5/Flag_of_Saudi_Arabia_%281938%E2%80%931973%29.svg/40px-Flag_of_Saudi_Arabia_%281938%E2%80%931973%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c5/Flag_of_Saudi_Arabia_%281938%E2%80%931973%29.svg/60px-Flag_of_Saudi_Arabia_%281938%E2%80%931973%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="Saudi Arabia" data-file-width="900" data-file-height="600" data-file-type="drawing" height="15" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span></span> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saudi_Arabia" title="Saudi Arabia" id="mwC6U">Saudi Arabia</a>: 1 March 1945<sup about="#mwt1112" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Martin_148-27" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"Martin"}}'><a href="#cite_note-Martin-148" id="mwC6Y"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwC6c"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwC6g">[</span>141<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwC6k">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
<li id="mwC6o"><span class="flagicon" about="#mwt1113" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwC6s" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"flagicon","href":"./Template:Flagicon"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Finland"}},"i":0}}]}'><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Finland" title="Finland"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Finland.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bc/Flag_of_Finland.svg/40px-Flag_of_Finland.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bc/Flag_of_Finland.svg/60px-Flag_of_Finland.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="Finland" data-file-width="1800" data-file-height="1100" data-file-type="drawing" height="14" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span></span> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Finland" title="Finland" id="mwC6w">Finland</a>: 3 March 1945<sup about="#mwt1115" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Martin_148-28" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"Martin"}}'><a href="#cite_note-Martin-148" id="mwC60"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwC64"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwC68">[</span>141<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwC7A">]</span></span></a></sup><span typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Entity" about="#mwt1114" id="mwC7E" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"snd","href":"./Template:Snd"},"params":{},"i":0}}]}'> </span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt1114">–</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt1114"> </span>former ally of Germany in the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Continuation_War" title="Continuation War" id="mwC7I">Continuation War</a>. On 3 March 1945, Finland retroactively declared war on Germany from 15 September 1944.</li>
<li id="mwC7M"><span class="flagicon" about="#mwt1116" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwC7Q" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"flagicon","href":"./Template:Flagicon"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Argentina"},"2":{"wt":"1831"}},"i":0}}]}'><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Argentina" title="Argentina"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Argentina.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/Flag_of_Argentina.svg/40px-Flag_of_Argentina.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/Flag_of_Argentina.svg/60px-Flag_of_Argentina.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="Argentina" data-file-width="800" data-file-height="500" data-file-type="drawing" height="14" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span></span> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Argentina" title="Argentina" id="mwC7U">Argentina</a>: 27 March 1945<sup about="#mwt1117" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-160" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-160"}}'><a href="#cite_note-160" id="mwC7Y"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwC7c"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwC7g">[</span>153<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwC7k">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
<li id="mwC7o"><span class="flagicon" about="#mwt1118" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwC7s" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"flagicon","href":"./Template:Flagicon"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Chile"}},"i":0}}]}'><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chile" title="Chile"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Chile.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/78/Flag_of_Chile.svg/40px-Flag_of_Chile.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/78/Flag_of_Chile.svg/60px-Flag_of_Chile.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="Chile" data-file-width="900" data-file-height="600" data-file-type="drawing" height="15" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span></span> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Presidential_Republic_(1925–1973)" title="Presidential Republic (1925–1973)" id="mwC7w">Chile</a>: 11 April 1945 declared war on Germany and Japan.<sup about="#mwt1119" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Martin_148-29" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"Martin"}}'><a href="#cite_note-Martin-148" id="mwC70"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwC74"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwC78">[</span>141<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwC8A">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
<li id="mwC8E"><span class="flagicon" about="#mwt1120" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwC8I" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"flagicon","href":"./Template:Flagicon"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Kingdom of Italy"}},"i":0}}]}'><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kingdom_of_Italy" title="Kingdom of Italy"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Italy_(1861-1946)_crowned.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0d/Flag_of_Italy_%281861-1946%29_crowned.svg/40px-Flag_of_Italy_%281861-1946%29_crowned.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0d/Flag_of_Italy_%281861-1946%29_crowned.svg/60px-Flag_of_Italy_%281861-1946%29_crowned.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="Kingdom of Italy" data-file-width="1500" data-file-height="1000" data-file-type="drawing" height="15" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span></span> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kingdom_of_the_South" title="Kingdom of the South" id="mwC8M">Italy</a>: On 14 July 1945 the Kingdom of Italy formally declared war on Japan<sup about="#mwt1123" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-161" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-161"}}'><a href="#cite_note-161" id="mwC8Q"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwC8U"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwC8Y">[</span>154<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwC8c">]</span></span></a></sup> (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Military_history_of_Italy_during_World_War_II" title="Military history of Italy during World War II" id="mwC8g">Italy and Japan after the surrender</a>)</li></ul>

</section></section><section data-mw-section-id="70" id="mwC8k" aria-labelledby="See_also"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="See_also">See also</h2></div>
