<li id="mwC9M"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Free_World" title="Free World" about="#mwt1129" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwC9Q" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"annotated link","href":"./Template:Annotated_link"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Free World"}},"i":0}}]}'>Free World</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt1129"> </span><span about="#mwt1129">– Propaganda term used to refer to the Western Bloc</span></li>
<li id="mwC9U"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Military_production_during_World_War_II" title="Military production during World War II" about="#mwt1130" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwC9Y" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"annotated link","href":"./Template:Annotated_link"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Military production during World War II"}},"i":0}}]}'>Military production during World War II</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt1130"> </span><span about="#mwt1130">– Arms and munitions produced during the Second World War</span></li>
