ndon&amp;rft.pub=Thames+%26+Hudson&amp;rft.date=2019&amp;rft.isbn=978-0-500-02292-4&amp;rft.aulast=Aubin&amp;rft.aufirst=Nicolas&amp;rft.au=Bernard%2C+Vincent&amp;rft.au=Guillerat%2C+Nicolas&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AAllies+of+World+War+II" class="Z3988" about="#mwt301" id="mwDic"></span></span></li>
