a>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=Romania&amp;rft.btitle=The+Oxford+Companion+to+World+War+II&amp;rft.pub=Oxford+University+Press&amp;rft.date=2014&amp;rft_id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1093%2Facref%2F9780198604464.001.0001&amp;rft.isbn=9780191727603&amp;rft.aulast=Deletant&amp;rft.aufirst=Dennis&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AAllies+of+World+War+II" class="Z3988" about="#mwt659" id="mwEVs"></span></span></li>
